*> Acceptance test, raid arithmetic and the omen (docs/protocol/20 sections 14.2 and 14.3; lane 002-lane-mobsb5, T8901): waves by difficulty, the default wave table and the bonus
*> rules, enchant odds, omen level, the ring of spawn offsets, village test, Bad Omen to Raid Omen to a raid with a centre and an omen level.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. ACC-US15-RAID-OMEN.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY CORESTATE.
 COPY BRWORLD.
 COPY RAIDSTATE.
 01 WS-PLAYER              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DIM                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-A                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-B                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-C                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-D                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-E                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ANGLE               FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-OX                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-OZ                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-X                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-Y                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-Z                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-LEVEL               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-LEFT                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BAD                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 30.
 01 WS-ROMEN               BINARY-LONG VALUE 34.
 01 WS-AMP                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-DUR                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 120000.
 01 WS-FLAGS               BINARY-LONG VALUE 4.
 01 WS-KIND2               BINARY-LONG VALUE 2.
 01 WS-YES                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SLOT                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ZERO                BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-ZERO2               BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-DRX                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DRZ                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ONE                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     CALL "MS-TEST-OPEN" USING WS-PLAYER
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE PL-DIM(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-DIM
*>   Number of waves.
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 3
         CALL "RAID-NUM-GROUPS" USING WS-I WS-A
         MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 waves by difficulty 0 3 5 7" TO TL-CASE
         EVALUATE WS-I
             WHEN 0 MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
             WHEN 1 MOVE 3 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
             WHEN 2 MOVE 5 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
             WHEN 3 MOVE 7 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
         END-EVALUATE
         MOVE WS-A TO TL-OBSERVED-N
         CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     END-PERFORM
*>   Default table: type 1 vindicator, 2 evoker, 3 pillager, 4 witch, 5 ravager.
     MOVE 1 TO WS-A
     MOVE 7 TO WS-B
     CALL "RAID-DEFAULT" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 vindicators in wave 7" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 5 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-C TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 2 TO WS-A
     CALL "RAID-DEFAULT" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 evokers in wave 7" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 2 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-C TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 3 TO WS-A
     MOVE 1 TO WS-B
     CALL "RAID-DEFAULT" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 pillagers in wave 1" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 4 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-C TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 4 TO WS-A
     MOVE 4 TO WS-B
     CALL "RAID-DEFAULT" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 witches in wave 4" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 3 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-C TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 5 TO WS-A
     MOVE 3 TO WS-B
     CALL "RAID-DEFAULT" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 ravagers in wave 3" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-C TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
*>   Bonus maximum: type, difficulty, wave, bonus group, easy draw (0 or 1).
     MOVE 4 TO WS-A
     MOVE 2 TO WS-B
     MOVE 3 TO WS-C
     CALL "RAID-BONUS-MAX" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C WS-ZERO WS-ZERO2 WS-D
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 a witch can be added from wave 3 on Normal" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-D TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 4 TO WS-C
     CALL "RAID-BONUS-MAX" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C WS-ZERO WS-ZERO2 WS-D
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 never in wave 4" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-D TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 2 TO WS-C
     CALL "RAID-BONUS-MAX" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C WS-ZERO WS-ZERO2 WS-D
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 never in wave 2" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-D TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 6 TO WS-C
     CALL "RAID-BONUS-MAX" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C WS-ONE WS-ZERO WS-D
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 the Normal bonus wave 6 can add a witch" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-D TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-B
     MOVE 3 TO WS-C
     CALL "RAID-BONUS-MAX" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C WS-ZERO WS-ZERO2 WS-D
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 no witch bonus on Easy" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-D TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 5 TO WS-A
     MOVE 3 TO WS-B
     CALL "RAID-BONUS-MAX" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C WS-ONE WS-ZERO WS-D
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 a ravager can be added in the Hard bonus group" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-D TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "RAID-BONUS-MAX" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C WS-ZERO WS-ZERO2 WS-D
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 not outside the bonus group" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-D TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-A
     MOVE 3 TO WS-B
     CALL "RAID-BONUS-MAX" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C WS-ZERO WS-ZERO2 WS-D
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 vindicators on Hard add up to 2" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 2 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-D TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 2 TO WS-B
     CALL "RAID-BONUS-MAX" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C WS-ZERO WS-ZERO2 WS-D
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 vindicators on Normal add up to 1" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-D TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-B
     CALL "RAID-BONUS-MAX" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C WS-ZERO WS-ONE WS-D
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 vindicators on Easy follow the first draw (1)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-D TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "RAID-BONUS-MAX" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C WS-ZERO WS-ZERO2 WS-D
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 vindicators on Easy follow the first draw (0)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-D TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 2 TO WS-A
     CALL "RAID-BONUS-MAX" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C WS-ZERO WS-ZERO2 WS-D
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 evokers never get a bonus" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-D TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
*>   A wave count: Normal wave 5 has 1 evoker exactly and 1 or 2 vindicators.
     MOVE 2 TO WS-A
     MOVE 2 TO WS-B
     MOVE 5 TO WS-C
     CALL "RAID-WAVE-COUNT" USING WS-A WS-C WS-B WS-ZERO WS-D
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 wave 5 on Normal has exactly 1 evoker" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-D TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-A
     CALL "RAID-WAVE-COUNT" USING WS-A WS-C WS-B WS-ZERO WS-D
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.3 wave 5 on Normal has 4 or 5 vindicators" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE 0 TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     IF WS-D = 4 OR WS-D = 5
         MOVE 1 TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     END-IF
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
*>   Enchant odds in thousandths by omen level and the omen level clamp.
     MOVE 3 TO WS-A
     CALL "RAID-ENCHANT-ODDS" USING WS-A WS-B
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 omen 3 enchants with 0.25" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 250 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-B TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-A
     CALL "RAID-ENCHANT-ODDS" USING WS-A WS-B
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 omen 1 never enchants" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-B TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 5 TO WS-A
     CALL "RAID-ENCHANT-ODDS" USING WS-A WS-B
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 omen 5 enchants with 0.75" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 750 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-B TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 4 TO WS-A
     MOVE 2 TO WS-B
     CALL "RAID-OMEN-ADD" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 omen level 4 plus amplifier 2 plus 1 clamps at 5" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 5 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-C TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 0 TO WS-A
     MOVE 1 TO WS-B
     CALL "RAID-OMEN-ADD" USING WS-A WS-B WS-C
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 omen level 0 plus amplifier 1 plus 1 is 2" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 2 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-C TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
*>   Spawn offsets: cooldown 300 gives f = 3.06; attempt 0 at angle 0 is 97 east; attempt 4 at a quarter turn is 97 south.
     MOVE 0 TO WS-ANGLE
     MOVE 0 TO WS-A
     MOVE 300 TO WS-B
     MOVE WS-A TO WS-DRX WS-DRZ
     CALL "RAID-SPAWN-OFFSET" USING WS-B WS-ANGLE WS-A WS-DRX WS-DRZ WS-OX WS-OZ
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 offset east at cooldown 300" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 97 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-OX TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 4 TO WS-A
     MOVE 0 TO WS-C
     MOVE WS-C TO WS-DRX WS-DRZ
     CALL "RAID-SPAWN-OFFSET" USING WS-B WS-ANGLE WS-A WS-DRX WS-DRZ WS-OX WS-OZ
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 offset south at attempt 4" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 97 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-OZ TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 2 TO WS-C
     MOVE 0 TO WS-A
     MOVE WS-C TO WS-DRX WS-DRZ
     CALL "RAID-SPAWN-OFFSET" USING WS-B WS-ANGLE WS-A WS-DRX WS-DRZ WS-OX WS-OZ
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 the nextInt draw adds draw x floor(f) = 6" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 103 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-OX TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 0 TO WS-B
     MOVE 0 TO WS-C
     MOVE WS-C TO WS-DRX WS-DRZ
     CALL "RAID-SPAWN-OFFSET" USING WS-B WS-ANGLE WS-A WS-DRX WS-DRZ WS-OX WS-OZ
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 cooldown 0 mirrors through the centre (f = -0.24)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE -8 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-OX TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
*>   Village test and the omen chain.
     COMPUTE WS-X = FUNCTION INTEGER(PL-X(WS-PLAYER))
     COMPUTE WS-Y = FUNCTION INTEGER(PL-Y(WS-PLAYER))
     COMPUTE WS-Z = FUNCTION INTEGER(PL-Z(WS-PLAYER))
     CALL "RAID-IS-VILLAGE" USING WS-DIM WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-YES
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 no village without points of interest" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-YES TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "EFFECT-ADD" USING WS-PLAYER WS-BAD WS-AMP WS-DUR WS-FLAGS
     CALL "RAID-PLAYER-TICK" USING WS-PLAYER
     CALL "EFFECT-LEVEL" USING WS-PLAYER WS-BAD WS-LEVEL WS-LEFT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 Bad Omen outside a village stays" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-LEVEL TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     COMPUTE WS-A = WS-X + 3
     CALL "PXI-ADD" USING WS-DIM WS-A WS-Y WS-Z WS-KIND2
     COMPUTE WS-A = WS-X + 5
     CALL "PXI-ADD" USING WS-DIM WS-A WS-Y WS-Z WS-KIND2
     CALL "RAID-IS-VILLAGE" USING WS-DIM WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-YES
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 a bell in the next section makes a village" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-YES TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 3 TO BW-DIFFICULTY
     CALL "RAID-PLAYER-TICK" USING WS-PLAYER
     CALL "EFFECT-LEVEL" USING WS-PLAYER WS-BAD WS-LEVEL WS-LEFT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 in a village Bad Omen ends" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-LEVEL TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "EFFECT-LEVEL" USING WS-PLAYER WS-ROMEN WS-LEVEL WS-LEFT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 and Raid Omen lasts 600 ticks" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 600 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-LEFT TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "EFFECT-REMOVE" USING WS-PLAYER WS-ROMEN
     MOVE 1 TO WS-DUR
     CALL "EFFECT-ADD" USING WS-PLAYER WS-ROMEN WS-AMP WS-DUR WS-FLAGS
     CALL "RAID-PLAYER-TICK" USING WS-PLAYER
     MOVE 0 TO WS-SLOT
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > RD-MAX
         IF RD-USED(WS-I) = 1
             MOVE WS-I TO WS-SLOT
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 the last tick of Raid Omen creates a raid" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE 0 TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     IF WS-SLOT > 0
         MOVE 1 TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     END-IF
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 the raid centre is the average of the two bells" TO TL-CASE
     COMPUTE TL-EXPECTED-N = WS-X + 4
     MOVE RD-CX(WS-SLOT) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 omen level is amplifier + 1" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RD-OMEN(WS-SLOT) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 the new raid waits 300 ticks" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 300 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RD-COOLDOWN(WS-SLOT) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
*>   A second omen at the same centre extends the same raid.
     CALL "EFFECT-REMOVE" USING WS-PLAYER WS-ROMEN
     MOVE 1 TO WS-AMP
     CALL "EFFECT-ADD" USING WS-PLAYER WS-ROMEN WS-AMP WS-DUR WS-FLAGS
     MOVE WS-X TO RP-X(WS-PLAYER)
     MOVE WS-Y TO RP-Y(WS-PLAYER)
     MOVE WS-Z TO RP-Z(WS-PLAYER)
     MOVE 1 TO RP-SET(WS-PLAYER)
     CALL "RAID-PLAYER-TICK" USING WS-PLAYER
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 a second omen extends the same raid by amplifier + 1" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 3 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RD-OMEN(WS-SLOT) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     STOP RUN.
 END PROGRAM ACC-US15-RAID-OMEN.

 COPY CORETEST.
 COPY MOBSPTEST.
